criteria.c1:
Met in the accepted run, for both seed worlds (42 and 43).
Player:
- walked a generated land route out to the wall target (around the closed wall) and back to town_1 (through the open wall);
- set sail at town_1's port with SetSailAtPosition, 6.7/4.6 units from where it stood at the gate. This is the call the town's leave-by-sea menu makes; the player does not embark by walking onto water in the native game;
- sailed entirely at sea to whichever destination the engine's naval distance made nearer: in world 42 the other landmass's coast (25.5 units), in world 43 town_2's waters (427.3 units);
- disembarked (1 transition).
AI (the generated ruler, from its natural stock spawn point, with no reset, under a scripted order SetDoNotMakeNewDecisions + SetMoveGoToPoint(All)):
- crossed land, embarked, sailed and disembarked onto a different, water-separated landmass (2 transitions; 240/559 land and 104/213 sea samples);
- then made the return trip to town_1 (2 transitions).
Engine land, sea and cross-landmass routes were queried in both directions.

criteria.c3:
Met for the generated-mesh scope. Recorded per world:
- face identities (index, group, island, land/sea lookup) for every fixture point;
- the active models (NavalPartyNavigationModel, NavalDLCMapDistanceModel) and invalid terrain sets per navigation type;
- region switch costs (50/50; All-type engine distances include them, e.g. AI route 213.5 vs 113.1 traveled), the embark threshold, and the native-backed calls versus campaign APIs invoked;
- per-route path construction time (0.002-2.7 ms) and per-world navigation cache build time (Default/Naval/All 2.3/5.9/26.5 s and 3.4/25.8/44.4 s);
- distance-model values beside engine distances: Default identical; Naval 0.05%/1.25% apart; PathExistBetweenPoints matches the engine.
Also recorded: the face-island renumbering and stale-cache effect of SetAbilityOfFacesWithId, and the probe's compensation.
Stitching: not exercised and not applicable (one generated navmesh per world). RuntimeNavigationProbe (the 'nav' autorun, restored from IL this session and not re-run) last ran on 2026-10-09: it showed official prefab import, runtime-authored prefabs imported 0 faces, and campaignBackendAccepted=false.
